        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/west-rancho-dominguez-22054",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "West Rancho Dominguez first appeared as an unincorporated community in the 1970 U.S. Census.",
